checkpoint:
  id: w9-premium-documentation
  date: 2026-06-11
  type: documentation-release
  scope: kazuba-rust-core
  parent: w8-v3-1-0-release
  version: 3.1.0 → 3.1.0 (docs rev)

purpose: |
  W9 Documentation Premium Elite: full documentation overhaul of
  kazuba-rust-core to Premium Elite de Mercado standard. Aligned with
  Diátaxis, MkDocs Material premium features, and context7 best
  practices for Rust crate documentation.

